-          <t indent="0" pn="section-14.2.1-15">ACCESS4_LOOKUP  Look up a name in a directory (no meaning for non-
-                directory objects).</t>
-          <t indent="0" pn="section-14.2.1-16">ACCESS4_MODIFY  Rewrite existing file data or modify existing
